   m=11  ord(J)= 10  ord(phi)= 10  lcm(5,ord phi)= 10  True
   m=13  ord(J)=140  ord(phi)= 28  lcm(5,ord phi)=140  True
PASS C1 residue period law holds for m in {2,3,4,5,7,11,13}
== D  integer size runs away in both time directions (no arrow in coefficient size)
